+ * PTC runtime keeps only PATH/PATHEXT/SYSTEMROOT/WINDIR/TEMP/TMP — drops that
+ * variable, so prefixing with `process.execPath` hands `runner.js` to Electron
+ * as a GUI app. It then takes the single-instance path and exits 0 without ever
+ * loading the script, so every confined PTC execution fails as
